== Prestige class tips ==
*Fighters have many options available to them - [[blackguard]] (evil only), [[dwarven defender]] (lawful dwarven only), or [[weapon master]] are among the best choices.
*Elf and half-elf fighters who use bows and multiclass as wizards (the elf's favored class), sorcerers, or bards, may want to consider becoming [[arcane archer]]s.
*Non-evil fighters could consider [[champion of Torm]] since it offers many defensive advantages and little loss of fighter class abilities.

== Notes ==
* During [[character creation]], the "Recommended" button selects the fighter class.
* The fighter is the only class that has access to the [[weapon specialization]] feat.

